spec: format-reference.md#extended-attributes
question: Confirm the capability and trusted xattrs are stored and hashed
 identically by both implementations. Build and run these cells at real root
 only: a capability xattr written from a user namespace is stored in a
 namespaced revision carrying a rootid, so its bytes and the object checksum
 differ from the real-root form.

