spec: format-reference.md#extended-attributes
question: The reference behavior drops an existing security.selinux xattr at
 commit and re-applies the policy label, so the label is not counted twice in the
 checksum. Confirm both implementations agree on the resulting checksum. Blocked
 on this development host, which runs no SELinux kernel; needs a Fedora or
 CentOS Stream environment.

