spec: format-reference.md#commit-modifier-canonical-permissions-consume-and-devino
question: Two paths sharing one inode and a third path with the same content on
 a separate inode all hash to one content object. Confirm the object inventory
 holds exactly one content object for the three paths in each mode, and that the
 devino cache does not change the result.

