oracle: checksum-agreement inventory
evidence: -
question: Observe the payload-link threshold behavior. Record whether the tool
 writes a .payload-link object for the over-threshold file in each mode, at what
 size, and which config key sets it. The port's config parser does not yet know
 a payload-link-threshold key. Record also how a sparse file is stored and
 whether the hole survives a checkout.

